      "funding_type": "grant",
      "typical_award_size": "HHAP-6 County application $708,617 (Resolution 2025-67, August 26, 2025; HCD allocation $708,616.98), used for the County homeless shelter (over 100 beds), hotel vouchers for about 40 people and rapid rehousing for about five youth. The CoC allocation of $3,725,577.82 is shared with Monterey County through the Coalition of Homeless Services Providers. Prior rounds: HHAP-1 $308,848.53, HHAP-2 $141,188, HHAP-3 $547,468 (plus a $294,330 CoC HHAP-1 pass-through for rapid rehousing). HHAP-7 preliminary allocations: County $786,253.74, CoC $4,166,944.25.",
